// Xunara Platform API v2 over gRPC (M8d).
//
// This service mirrors the read-mostly /api/v2 surface of one organization so
// automation can use a typed protocol instead of scraping JSON. It is part of
// the platform plane: it never touches the Tailscale compatibility core
// (TS2021, Noise, MapRequest), and credentials are the same service API keys
// the HTTP API accepts.
